YOUR TASK: Complete this task: Implement the telescoped one-dimensional O(n^2) DP in `Solution.minimumCost`: compute prefix sums `N` for `nums` and `C` for `cost`; set `dp[0] = 0`; for `i = 1..n-1`, compute `dp[i] = min_{0 <= j < i} dp[j] + N[i] * (C[i] - C[j]) + k * (C[n] - C[i])`; then return `min_{0 <= j < n} dp[j] + N[n] * (C[n] - C[j]) + k * C[n]`; run the provided examples and confirm outputs `110` and `985`.